The files obfuscated2.go and faketls.go in this directory, and the padded
intermediate framing in framing.go, are ported from github.com/gotd/td
v0.161.0 (commit d642c299fe122f4cf60bd91f0a88026587cd9300; packages mtproxy,
mtproxy/obfuscated2, mtproxy/faketls and proto/codec) and adapted to the
standard library. github.com/gotd/td is not a dependency of this module.

